          "description": "Goop Tales is a screen-free audio adventure podcast for kids ages 4–10. Original kids stories packed with wild characters, surprising twists, and worlds that spark imagination — no screen required.\r\nEach episode follows a Goop — a funny little character named after a naughty habit — who travels to a real place in the world and learns something along the way. These children's stories teach geography, vocabulary, and character development the way kids actually absorb things: through their ears and imagination.\r\nWith 139 original kids audio stories and over 1.6 million downloads, Goop Tales is what parents put on when they want their kids genuinely captivated. Perfect for bedtime, car rides, and anytime you need 30 minutes of peace. Free on Apple Podcasts, Spotify, and everywhere you listen.",
